From 617747450aee48e592d701de90b570b6729007ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shunhua Lan <lsh@rock-chips.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Aug 2021 15:49:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 062/232] media: rk628-for-all: rk628_bt1120_v4l2: fix audio
 issues

1. reset hdmi in cru when hotplug or res change to avoid audio L/R channel swap
2. disable hdmirx and audio unit when PHY setup
3. enable audio unit after N CTS updating
4. enable audio interrupts before PHY setup
5. double init audio fifo when fifo both underflow and overflow
6. media: i2c: fix i2c access timeout
7. add 60ms delay after phy locked

Change-Id: Iec24861941bae98a04e94b1122b78f27dd3754b4
Signed-off-by: Shunhua Lan <lsh@rock-chips.com>
Signed-off-by: Guochun Huang <hero.huang@rock-chips.com>
